%%% note
由来: mulet test/mulet/io_test.clj:69 (writeCsv-quoteValues-test)
testing: quoteValues forces data fields to be quoted
元の形: io/writeCsv の直接呼び出しを DW に書き換え
mulet: 成功
%%% script
%dw 2.0
output application/json
---
write([{"name": "Alice", "age": 30}], "application/csv", {"quoteValues": true})
%%% output application/json
"name,age\n\"Alice\",\"30\"\n"
